    "intro_narrative": "You awaken within the Star-Gazer’s Observatory, a floating tower suspended between the physical realm and the shimmering astral sea. Glowing ley lines pulse beneath your feet, and the scent of ozone and ancient parchment fills the air. You have been chosen to reignite the Eternal Flame, the only source of power capable of stabilizing this crumbling sanctuary and opening a gateway home. To succeed, you must navigate a sequence of enchanted relics left behind by Master Elara. Each device is a puzzle, and only by correctly channeling the flow of information between them can you unlock the tower's final secret. Tension mounts as the celestial alignment begins to shift—you must act quickly before the observatory drifts into the void forever.",
